      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Zone A, with its high median income and established demographic profile, is likely the safest bet for high-end development and stable property value increases. Conversely, Zone C presents the highest risk profile due to significantly lower median income and a highly concentrated demographic makeup, suggesting potential volatility. Zone B holds moderate potential, showing income growth opportunities in a diversifying area. Zone D offers a balanced mix, providing potential middle-to-upper-market growth while maintaining demographic diversity.",
